    "explanation": "Junkrat's low Health pool and squishiness require him to hide behind a strong frontline that can distract enemy Heroes during fights. Tanks and bruisers with reliable crowd-control can either help Junkrat set-up takedowns, or assist him with peel should he be focused by the enemy team. A support that can provide Junkrat with healing or damage mitigation in the form of a shield or buffs is mandatory as he has no source of self-sustain within his entire kit."
  },
