    "weaker": [],
    "explanation": "As noted earlier, Junkrat provides excellent lane sustain, teamfight presence, and wave clear. All of these traits make him good on maps where a rotation between lanes is needed and has a \"king of the hill\" type of objective, such as the Altars on Towers of Doom. The poke damage provided by Frag Launcher can be used to indefinitely whittle down enemies from afar as they attempt to take control of an objective. On bigger maps, Junkrat can make good use of his level 13 talent Ripper Air which allows him to quickly move from lane to lane. Maps with smaller choke points make Steel Trap a particularly effective zoning tool while Concussion Mine can catch an unaware enemy off-guard and force them into a detrimental position. Fighting an enemy team forced into a narrow corridor will also generate the most value from the splash-damage component of his abilities and Basic Attacks."
  },
